          "source": "# A kick on every beat, a snare on two and four, a hat on every eighth whose\n# velocity the seed and one param decide (ADR 0024 §3's worked example).\nfor b in range(4):\n    note(36, beat(b), beat(1) // 2, 100)\n    if b % 2 == 1:\n        note(38, beat(b), beat(1) // 2, 110)\n    for h in range(2):\n        note(42, beat(b) + h * (beat(1) // 2), beat(1) // 4, 60 + rng.randrange(0, int(params[\"spread\"])))\n",
